// A parameter list with a canonicalisation begun over it, for canon_params.
//
// gn_env (mid/names/exports/reach/branch.id) is the one fixture that exports a
// list of parameter nodes rather than a bare one, and its chain reaches
// fwd_env, so the symbol index is there too. param_begun_fixture cannot be
// reused: farm_a is a sibling of gn_env's base rather than a link in its
// chain, so f_pgen_list is not set under it.
//
// Filed as its own file because native.id and tail.id are both at the
// three-function limit; this directory had room for a third entry.

paramlist_begun_fixture() {
  gn_env();
  uq_begin("f");
} return void;
():() then check_failed:(0)
